[{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0173","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0173.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-0118","title":"Infopop Ultimate Bulletin Board 跨站脚本攻击漏洞","description":"Infopop Ultimate Bulletin Board (UBB) 6.2.0 Beta Release 1.0 及更早版本存在跨站脚本（XSS）漏洞。远程攻击者可通过在论坛帖子中构造包含编码 JavaScript 代码的 IMG 标签，当其他用户浏览该帖子时，恶意脚本将在用户浏览器中自动执行，导致攻击者可窃取用户会话 Cookie、伪造页面内容或执行其他恶意操作。该漏洞无需身份认证即可利用，影响 UBB 5.4/6.0/6.2 等多个版本。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2002-0118"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2002-03-25T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:56:49Z","remediation":"升级 Infopop Ultimate Bulletin Board 至 6.2.0 正式版或更高版本，该 Beta 版本存在 IMG 标签编码 JavaScript 的 XSS 漏洞。如无法升级，在服务器端对用户提交的 IMG 标签中 src 属性进行严格过滤，禁止包含 javascript:、onerror、onload 等事件处理器，并对 HTML 特殊字符进行 HTML 实体编码转义。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["http://online.securityfocus.com/archive/1/249031","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/7838.php","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/3829","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21209","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/0118bdf83d51e7ec6262ccd7acc694cb751b5bf8/cves/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0118.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-0118","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/d2f32d8750bd50219425137a8fc56ab841cc707b/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-0118.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-0118.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/0ccbe74701d72e8d7117a09b2db369605fa0bae6/2002/CVE-2002-0118.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2002-0118.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/c8205feda508d733c873e4904e8ec7780820d9e3/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0118.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/3e38e95f2e1dd1607b843a3c921eb524d7c4f47f/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-01xx/CVE-2002-0118.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0118.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0118.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2002/POC-AVE-2002-0173.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2002/EXP-AVE-2002-0173.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0173.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0171","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0171.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-0117","title":"YaBB 跨站脚本漏洞","description":"YaBB（Yet Another Bulletin Board）1 Gold SP1及更早版本存在跨站脚本漏洞。由于对用户提交的论坛消息中IMG标签内的Javascript代码编码形式过滤不严，远程攻击者可在论坛帖子中嵌入经过编码的恶意脚本代码。当其他用户浏览该帖子时，脚本会在受害者浏览器中执行，攻击者可借此窃取用户的Cookie认证凭据，实现会话劫持。攻击者无需身份认证即可通过构造特制的论坛消息触发该漏洞，影响范围广泛。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2002-0117"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2002-03-25T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:56:49Z","remediation":"升级 YaBB 至 1 Gold SP 1 之后的补丁版本，该版本已修复 IMG 标签中编码 JavaScript 的过滤问题。由于 YaBB 已停止维护，建议迁移至其他活跃维护的论坛软件（如 phpBB、Discourse）。临时缓解措施可在论坛配置中禁用 IMG BBCode 功能，或在 Web 应用防火墙层面对包含 `javascript:` 协议的 IMG 标签请求进行拦截。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["http://online.securityfocus.com/archive/1/249031","http://online.securityfocus.com/cgi-bin/vulns-item.pl?section=info&id=3828","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/7840.php","http://www.osvdb.org/2019","http://www.yabbforum.com/","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21208","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/93bf7691fc17bf58197ad166ee362b4808566d7c/cves/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0117.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-0117","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/d2f32d8750bd50219425137a8fc56ab841cc707b/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-0117.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-0117.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/0ccbe74701d72e8d7117a09b2db369605fa0bae6/2002/CVE-2002-0117.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2002-0117.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/c8205feda508d733c873e4904e8ec7780820d9e3/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0117.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/3e38e95f2e1dd1607b843a3c921eb524d7c4f47f/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-01xx/CVE-2002-0117.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0117.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2002-0117.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2002/POC-AVE-2002-0171.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2002/EXP-AVE-2002-0171.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0171.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0169","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0169.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-0115","title":"Martin Roesch Snort 1.8.3 ICMP 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Snort 1.8.3 未正确定义最小 ICMP 头部大小，远程攻击者可向运行 Snort 的目标系统发送特制的畸形 ICMP 数据包，触发内存访问越界导致 Snort 进程崩溃并产生核心转储。该漏洞无需身份认证即可远程触发，攻击复杂度低，主要影响 Snort 1.8.3 版本的入侵检测系统部署环境，可导致网络监控服务中断。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2002-0115"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2002-03-25T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:56:49Z","remediation":"建议立即升级 Snort 至 1.9.0 或更高版本，该版本已正确定义最小 ICMP 头部大小并修复此漏洞。如无法立即升级，可在 Snort 配置中添加规则过滤畸形 ICMP 数据包，或通过网络访问控制限制允许发送 ICMP 流量到 Snort 主机的来源 IP 范围作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["http://online.securityfocus.com/archive/1/249340","http://online.securityfocus.com/cgi-bin/archive.pl?id=1&start=2002-03-08&end=2002-03