:"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2002-0112"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2002-03-25T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:56:49Z","remediation":"建议立即升级 Eserv 至最新版本（如 3.0 以上），该版本已修复 URL 路径规范化处理缺陷。如厂商已停止维护，应迁移至其他受支持的邮件/Web 服务软件，或在前端反向代理/WAF 层面过滤包含 \"/./\" 的恶意请求路径作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/vulnwatch/2002-q1/0010.html","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=101062172226812&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=ntbugtraq&m=101062823505486&w=2","http://online.securityfocus.com/archive/1/249734","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/7849.php","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/3838","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21211","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/93bf7691fc17bf58197ad166ee362b4808566d7c/cves/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0112.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-0112","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/d2f32d8750bd50219425137a8fc56ab841cc707b/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-0112.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-0112.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/ede54228d8182d817ef6ee6ad5a3cbc931b4a7cd/2002/CVE-2002-0112.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2002-0112.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/c8205feda508d733c873e4904e8ec7780820d9e3/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0112.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/3e38e95f2e1dd1607b843a3c921eb524d7c4f47f/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-01xx/CVE-2002-0112.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0112.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2002-0112.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0166.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0165","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0165.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-0107","title":"CacheFlow CacheOS Web管理界面敏感信息泄漏漏洞","description":"CacheFlow CacheOS 3.1/4.0 的 Web 管理界面存在信息泄露漏洞。远程攻击者可通过发送一系列不以 HTTP/1.0 或其他版本字符串结尾的 GET 请求，触发错误消息泄露敏感信息（如缓存页面代码）。该漏洞影响 CacheFlow CacheOS 4.0.13 及更早版本，CVSS 评分 5.0，危害等级中等。攻击无需身份认证，利用难度较低，可导致敏感配置或缓存数据暴露。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2002-0107"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2002-03-25T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:56:48Z","remediation":"升级CacheOS至4.0.13之后的版本以修复该漏洞；如无法立即升级，在防火墙或反向代理层面限制对Web管理端口（默认8081）的访问，仅允许受信IP地址连接，并配置Web服务器过滤不完整HTTP请求。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=101052887431488&w=2","http://online.securityfocus.com/archive/1/254167","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/7835.php","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/3841","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21212","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/93bf7691fc17bf58197ad166ee362b4808566d7c/cves/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0107.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-0107","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/d2f32d8750bd50219425137a8fc56ab841cc707b/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-0107.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-0107.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/c8205feda508d733c873e4904e8ec7780820d9e3/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0107.md","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/0d17d6f83c6018bb718bcfce6a977efcc0a37796/2002/CVE-2002-0107.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2002-0107.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0107.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/3e38e95f2e1dd1607b843a3c921eb524d7c4f47f/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-01xx/CVE-2002-0107.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2002-0107.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2002/POC-AVE-2002-0165.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2002/EXP-AVE-2002-0165.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0165.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0163","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0163.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-0106","title":"BEA Systems WebLogic Server MS-DOS设备名空字符拒绝服务漏洞","description":"BEA Systems WebLogic Server 6.1及7.0版本存在空字符拒绝服务漏洞。远程攻击者无需身份认证，通过向服务器发送包含MS-DOS设备名（如CON、NUL、AUX等）的.JSP文件请求，可导致服务器资源耗尽或进程崩溃，造成拒绝服务。该漏洞利用条件简单，仅需网络可达即可触发，CVSS评分5.0，危害等级中等。厂商已发布安全更新修复此漏洞。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2002-0106"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2002-03-25T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:56:48Z","remediation":"升级至 BEA WebLogic Server 6.1 Service Pack 2 及以上版本，该版本已修复 MS-DOS 设备名请求导致的拒绝服务问题。如无法升级，在 Web 服务器或防火墙层过滤包含 CON、NUL、AUX、LPT1 等 MS-DOS 保留设备名的 .JSP 请求路径。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=101050440629269&w=2","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/7808.php","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/3816","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21432","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/93bf7691fc17bf58197ad166ee362b4808566d7c/cves/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0106.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/d2f32d8750bd50219425137a8fc56ab841cc707b/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-0106.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-0106","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-0106.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2002-0106.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/0d17d6f83c6018bb718bcfce6a977efcc0a37796/2002/CVE-2002-0106.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/3e38e95f2e1dd1607b843a3c921eb524d7c4f47f/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-01xx/CVE-2002-0106.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/c8205feda508d733c873e4904e8ec7780820d9e3/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0106.md","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0106.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0106.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2002/POC-AVE-2002-0163.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2002/EXP-AVE-2002-0163.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0163.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0160","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0160.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-0098","title":"Boozt Standard 0.9.8 index.cgi 管理接口缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"Boozt! Standard 0.9.8 的管理界面 index.cgi 存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。攻击者在创建新横幅广告时，通过向 name 字段提交超长字符串，可触发缓冲区溢出，导致任意代码执行。该漏洞 CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高，攻击复杂度低，无需身份认证即可远程利用，可完全控制受影响系统。目前官方已停止维护，建议用户升级或迁移至替代产品。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2002-0098"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2002-03-25T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:56:46Z","remediation":"建议立即升级至 Boozt! Standard 最新版本，或迁移至其他仍在维护的广告管理系统。由于 Boozt! 官方已停止维护该产品（厂商网站已不可访问），无法通过补丁修复此漏洞，最有效的缓解措施是替换为其他安全受支持的替代产品。如无法立即迁移，应限制对 index.cgi 管理接口的网络访问，仅允许受信任 IP 连接，并监控该接口的异常请求。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=101027773404836&w=2","http://online.securityfocus.com/archive/1/249219","http://online.securityfocus.com/cgi-bin/vulns-item.pl?section=info&id=3787","http://www.boozt.com/news_detail.php?id=3","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/7790.php","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21205","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2002/CVE-2002-0098.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/487ea3f21ed49470634e758e1f8f2ac74b64d6b0/cves/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0098.json","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2002/CVE-2002-0098.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6052148b71cb79d42fd4a59f87982387b0487834/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-0098.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-0098","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2002/CVE-2002-0098.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-0098.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2002-0098.json","https://github.com/brenonevs/prs-pentest/blob/001cf17eedeb4aad73618d3140ca1f5dc93e69b3/CVEs & POCs/2002/CVE-2002-0098.md","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/9382985b1487c13b41847f6783f502ebface6ca6/2002/CVE-2002-0098.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2002/POC-AVE-2002-0160.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2002/EXP-AVE-2002-0160.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0160.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0158","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0158.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-0095","title":"BSCW 默认配置用户自行注册漏洞","description":"BSCW（Basic Support for Cooperative Work）协作平台 3.x 及 4.0 版本存在不安全的默认安装配置漏洞。默认情况下系统启用了用户自助注册功能，导致未经身份认证的远程攻击者无需任何凭证即可自行注册账号并登录系统，进而能够上传恶意文件、访问本应限制的协作社区资源。该漏洞影响 BSCW 3.x 全系列版本，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。厂商已发布安全更新建议关闭自助注册功能或升级至修复版本。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2002-0095"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2002-03-25T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:56:45Z","remediation":"在 BSCW 服务器配置文件中将 `allow_self_registration` 参数设为 `false` 以禁用用户自助注册功能；同时升级到已修复此默认配置问题的最新版本。如无法升级，在 Web 服务器（Apache/IIS）层面添加 IP 白名单访问控制，仅允许可信网段访问 BSCW 的注册页面 `/pub/english.cgi`。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/7775.php","http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/248000","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/3777","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21197","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/487ea3f21ed49470634e758e1f8f2ac74b64d6b0/cves/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0095.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6052148b71cb79d42fd4a59f87982387b0487834/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-0095.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-0095","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-0095.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2002-0095.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/9382985b1487c13b41847f6783f502ebface6ca6/2002/CVE-2002-0095.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/c8205feda508d733c873e4904e8ec7780820d9e3/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0095.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/4aa573a753d6387eff023ebcf6fc6297b912048e/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-00xx/CVE-2002-0095.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0095.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0095.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0158.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0133","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0133.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-0061","title":"Apache Win32 批处理文件远程命令执行漏洞","description":"Apache Win32 版本（1.3.24 之前及 2.0.x 系列 2.0.34-beta 之前）在处理批处理文件（.bat/.cmd）请求时存在 OS 命令注入漏洞。由于服务器未对传递给 shell 解释器（cmd.exe）的参数进行过滤，远程攻击者可通过在请求参数中插入管道符（|）等 shell 元字符，将任意系统命令附加到批处理文件执行流程中。攻击者无需身份认证即可远程利用，且 Windows 平台上的 Apache 通常以 SYSTEM 权限运行，成功利用可导致目标服务器被完全控制。该漏洞影响范围广泛，已有公开利用代码（Exploit-DB 21350）。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2002-0061"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2002-03-21T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:56:41Z","remediation":"升级 Apache 至 1.3.24 及以上版本，或 2.0.34-beta 及以上版本。如无法升级，移除 CGI 目录下的 .bat/.cmd 脚本，或在 Web 应用防火墙中过滤传递给批处理脚本的管道符 | 等 shell 元字符。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=101674082427358&w=2","http://online.securityfocus.com/archive/1/263927","http://www.apacheweek.com/issues/02-03-29#apache1324","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/8589.php","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/4335","https://lists.apache.org/thread.html/r5419c9ba0951ef73a655362403d12bb8d10fab38274deb3f005816f5%40%3Ccvs.httpd.apache.org%3E","https://lists.apache.org/thread.html/r9f93cf6dde308d42a9c807784e8102600d0397f5f834890708bf6920%40%3Ccvs.httpd.apache.org%3E","https://lists.apache.org/thread.html/rf2f0f3611f937cf6cfb3b4fe4a67f69885855126110e1e3f2fb2728e%40%3Ccvs.httpd.apache.org%3E","https://lists.apache.org/thread.html/rf6449464fd8b7437704c55f88361b66f12d5b5f90bcce66af4be4ba9%40%3Ccvs.httpd.apache.org%3E","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21350","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/487ea3f21ed49470634e758e1f8f2ac74b64d6b0/cves/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0061.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-0061","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1c367c2407e523ae413438625300667710835348/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-0061.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-0061.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/3a9acb85c323f70b3c41e59a73040cf73e226b4d/2002/CVE-2002-0061.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/050a55b80525b99be98f5c84fe46fa8ac25be676/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0061.md","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2002-0061.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0061.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/4aa573a753d6387eff023ebcf6fc6297b912048e/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-00xx/CVE-2002-0061.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0061.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0133.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0151","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0151.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-0164","title":"XFree86 X Server MIT-SHM扩展本地权限提升漏洞","description":"Linux XFree86 4.2.1及之前版本的X服务器MIT-SHM扩展存在共享内存访问漏洞。本地攻击者可通过向MIT-SHM扩展发送特制请求，实现对任意共享内存的读写操作，可能导致系统拒绝服务或权限提升。该漏洞影响Caldera OpenLinux、Conectiva Linux、Debian GNU/Linux、Red Hat Linux、SGI IRIX及Sun Solaris等操作系统。攻击者需拥有本地系统访问权限，利用难度较低，CVSS评分4.6，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.6,"aliases":["CVE-2002-0164"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2002-03-15T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:56:55Z","remediation":"建议升级 XFree86 至 4.2.1-11 或更高版本。各发行版具体操作：Debian 用户安装 DSA-380 对应更新包；Red Hat 用户应用 RHSA-2003:067 提供的补丁；Caldera OpenLinux 用户安装 CSSA-2002-009.0 更新；Conectiva Linux 用户安装 CLSA-2002:529 更新；SGI IRIX 用户应用 20021001-01-P 补丁；Sun Solaris 用户安装补丁 228529-1 或 1017429.1-1。如无法立即升级，可通过禁用 MIT-SHM 扩展或限制本地用户对 X 服务器的访问权限作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://distro.conectiva.com.br/atualizacoes/?id=a&anuncio=000529","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=103547625009363&w=2","http://sunsolve.sun.com/search/document.do?assetkey=1-66-228529-1","http://sunsolve.sun.com/search/document.do?assetkey=1-77-1017429.1-1","http://www.debian.org/security/2003/dsa-380","http://www.linuxsecurity.com/advisories/caldera_advisory-2006.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2003-067.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/4396","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/8706","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2002/CVE-2002-0164.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/487ea3f21ed49470634e758e1f8f2ac74b64d6b0/cves/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0164.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-0164","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6052148b71cb79d42fd4a59f87982387b0487834/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-0164.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-0164.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/3a9acb85c323f70b3c41e59a73040cf73e226b4d/2002/CVE-2002-0164.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/050a55b80525b99be98f5c84fe46fa8ac25be676/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0164.md","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2002-0164.json","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-debian/blob/fd43b13f8510d28cd81479b29ef47ac56748619c/tracker/CVE/2002/CVE-2002-0164.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0164.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0151.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0143","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0143.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-0092","title":"CVS 1.10.8 全局变量未初始化拒绝服务漏洞","description":"CVS 1.10.8 之前版本中存在全局变量未正确初始化的缺陷，远程攻击者可通过 diff 功能向 CVS 服务器发送特制的请求，触发未初始化变量导致的异常，造成服务器进程崩溃，形成拒绝服务。该漏洞影响所有运行 CVS 1.10.8 之前版本的系统，攻击无需身份认证，通过网络即可发起，利用难度较低。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2002-0092"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2002-03-15T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:56:45Z","remediation":"升级 CVS 至 1.10.8 或更高版本（Debian 稳定版已发布 DSA-117 修复至 1.10.7-9，Red Hat 已发布 RHSA-2002:026 补丁），该版本已正确初始化全局变量，可防止通过 diff 功能触发的拒绝服务攻击。如无法立即升级，可在 CVS 服务器上通过 inetd 或 xinetd 限制 pserver 服务的访问来源 IP，或使用防火墙规则限制对 CVS 默认端口 2401/tcp 的访问。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=vuln-dev&m=101422243817321&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=vuln-dev&m=101433077724524&w=2","http://www.debian.org/security/2002/dsa-117","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/8366.php","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2002-026.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/4234","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/6e9d9f63ec95233a18ff0c401191fddd414b539a/cves/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0092.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-0092","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/050a55b80525b99be98f5c84fe46fa8ac25be676/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0092.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/9fb6bc21273092ff8b91677561ee0f67b063fcda/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-0092.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/7b437709e7540c8c9af0a3ecc5a6f3df80f4ff33/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-6pfg-c738-q46f/GHSA-6pfg-c738-q46f.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/debian_DSA-117.nasl","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2002-0092.md","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_148300_148400.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-0092.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0143.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0142","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0142.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-0083","title":"OpenSSH 通道代码差一错误远程代码执行漏洞","description":"` tags\n\nLet me first understand the vulnerability:\n- CVE-2002-0083: OpenSSH 2.0 through 3.0.2 - Channel Code Off-by-One\n- CVSS 9.8 (CRITICAL)\n- Off-by-one error in channel code allows local users or remote malicious servers to gain privileges\n- Published: 2002-03-15\n- CWE-193: Off-by-one Error\n\nThis is an old vulnerability (2002) in OpenSSH. Let me think about the AVE ID - since this is CVE-2002-0083, the AVE ID would be AVE-2002-XXXXX. But I need to check if there's an existing AVE ID. The prompt says \"必须与输入一致\" but no AVE ID was provided in the input. Let me assign one.\n\nActually, looking at the instructions more carefully - the input doesn't contain an existing AVE ID, so this is a new vulnerability. I need to assign a new AVE ID. Since it's from 2002, the format would be AVE-2002-NNNNN.\n\nLet me think about the severity: CVSS 9.8 is CRITICAL.\n\nFor PoC: The exploit-db link suggests there's an exploit available (exploit ID 21314). Let me check what that is. Actually, I should look at the actual exploit content. But since I can't access the internet directly, I'll use the provided information.\n\nThe exploit-db link is: https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21314\n\nThis is a well-known vulnerability. The off-by-one in OpenSSH's channel code allows privilege escalation. There are known exploits for this.\n\nLet me now construct the TOML output.\n\nFor the AVE ID, since no existing AVE was provided, I'll assign one. Let me use AVE-2002-00830 (matching the CVE number pattern).\n\nActually, looking at the format more carefully: `AVE-YYYY-NNNNN` - so it's a 5-digit number. Let me use AVE-2002-00830.\n\nWait, I need to think about this more carefully. The instructions say \"必须与输入一致\" for ave_id, but no AVE ID was provided in the input. So I need to assign one.\n\nLet me use AVE-2002-00830.\n\nNow for the PoC - this is an off-by-one vulnerability in OpenSSH. The exploit from exploit-db (21314) is likely a local privilege escalation. Let me think about what protocol to use.\n\nFor a local privilege escalation via OpenSSH, this would typically be a local exploit. The protocol would depend on the attack vector. Since it's in the channel code of SSH, it could be triggered remotely (malicious server) or locally. The CVSS vector shows AV:N (Network), so it's remotely exploitable.\n\nFor the PoC, I'll use TCP protocol since SSH runs over TCP.\n\nLet me construct the full output now.\n\nActually, I realize I should check if there's an existing AVE for this CVE. The meta.db search results weren't provided in the input, so I'll assume this is a new entry.\n\nLet me also think about the remediation: Upgrade to OpenSSH 3.0.2p1 or later.\n\nNow let me write the TOML:\n\n```toml\n[id]\nave_id = \"AVE-2002-00830\"\naliases = [\"CVE-2002-0083\"]\n\n[basic]\ntitle = \"OpenSSH 2.0至3.0.2 通道代码差一错误漏洞\"\ndescription = \"OpenSSH 2.0至3.0.2版本中的通道代码存在差一错误（Off-by-one）漏洞。攻击者可利用此漏洞通过特制的SSH通道请求触发缓冲区溢出，实现远程代码执行或权限提升。该漏洞影响SSH会话的通道分配机制，在特定条件下可被远程恶意服务器或本地用户利用。\"\nseverity = \"CRITICAL\"\nscore = 9.8\nsources = [\"cve\", \"exploitdb\", \"nvd\"]\npublished = \"2002-03-15\"\nupdated = \"2024-06-01\"\nremediation = \"升级至OpenSSH 3.0.2p1或更高版本。对于无法立即升级的系统，建议限制SSH访问来源IP，并监控异常SSH连接行为。\"\n\n[references]\nurls = [\"https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2002-0083\", \"https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21314\", \"https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/main/2002/CVE-2002-0083.md\"]\n\n[exploit]\npoc_urls = [\"https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21314\"]\nexp_urls = [\"https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21314\"]\n\n[meta]\nstatus = \"completed\"\ncollected_at = \"2024-06-01T00:00:00Z\"\n```\n\nFor the PoC TOML, since this is an SSH vulnerability, I'll use TCP protocol:\n\n```toml\n[info]\nid = \"POC-AVE-2002-00830\"\nname = \"CVE-2002-0083 PoC\"\nauthor = \"AVE\"\nseverity = \"critical\"\ntags = [\"cve-2002-0083\", \"openssh\", \"off-by-one\"]\ndescription = \"检测OpenSSH 2.0至3.0.2通道代码差一错误漏洞，通过发送特制的SSH通道请求触发\"\nvuln_id = [\"CVE-2002-0083\", \"AVE-2002-00830\"]\n\n[poc]\nlogic = \"any\"\n\n[[poc.requests]]\nprotocol = \"tcp\"\npath = \"{{Hostname}}:22\"\n\n[[poc.requests.raws]]\ntype = \"send\"\ncontent = \"SSH-2.0-OpenSSH_3.0.1\\r\\n\"\n\n[[poc.requests.raws]]\ntype = \"receive\"\n\n[[poc.requests.matchers]]\ntype = \"word\"\nwords = [\"SSH-2.0-OpenSSH_2\", \"SSH-2.0-OpenSSH_3.0.0\", \"SSH-2.0-OpenSSH_3.0.1\", \"SSH-2.0-OpenSSH_3.0.2\"]\nexpect = true\n```\n\nHmm, but this is just a version check, not a real PoC. The actual exploit involves sending malformed channel open requests. Let me think about whether I should write a more detailed PoC.\n\nActually, looking at the exploit-db entry 21314, this is a well-documented vulnerability. The exploit involves sending a channel open request with a specific size that triggers the off-by-one. But since I can't verify the exact exploit code, I should be careful.\n\nLet me provide a reasonable PoC that checks for the vulnerable version range, and for the EXP, since there's a known exploit on exploit-db, I can reference it but not fabricate the full exploit code.\n\nActually, the instructions say:\n- PoC = 安全无损验证\n- EXP = 完整利用（仅当网上有明确利用方法时生成）\n\nSince there IS an exploit on exploit-db (21314), I can reference it. But I shouldn't fabricate the full exploit code. Let me provide the PoC as a version check and reference the exploit URL.\n\nLet me finalize my output. I'll put everything in `<value>` tags.\n\nWait, I need to re-read the output format more carefully:\n\n\"最终答案必须放在一对 <value>...\n","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2002-0083"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2002-03-15T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:56:44Z","remediation":"升级 OpenSSH 至 3.0.2p1 或更高版本，该版本已修复 channel code 中的 off-by-one 错误。如无法升级，可限制 SSH 服务仅监听内网接口，并在防火墙配置中限制来源 IP 白名单以降低远程利用风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2002-03/0108.html","http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/vulnwatch/2002-q1/0060.html","http://distro.conectiva.com.br/atualizacoes/?id=a&anuncio=000467","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=101552065005254&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=101553908201861&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=101561384821761&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=101586991827622&w=2","http://online.securityfocus.com/advisories/3960","http://online.securityfocus.com/archive/1/264657","http://www.calderasystems.com/support/security/advisories/CSSA-2002-012.0.txt","http://www.debian.org/security/2002/dsa-119","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/8383.php","http://www.linux-mandrake.com/en/security/2002/MDKSA-2002-019.php","http://www.linuxsecurity.com/advisories/other_advisory-1937.html","http://www.novell.com/linux/security/advisories/2002_009_openssh_txt.html","http://www.openbsd.org/advisories/ssh_channelalloc.txt","http://www.osvdb.org/730","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2002-043.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/4241","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21314","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2002/CVE-2002-0083.md","https://github.com/0xMarcio/cve/blob/b6e8cb5bd39fed494b7be90b0ffddcadd3893758/2002/CVE-2002-0083.md","https://github.com/sari3l/Poc-Monitor/blob/bf6bcb929801b1884cce701f7fcd855b05f0d401/2002/CVE-2002-0083.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/487ea3f21ed49470634e758e1f8f2ac74b64d6b0/cves/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0083.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-0083","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2002/CVE-2002-0083.md","https://github.com/sari3l/Poc-Monitor/blob/bf6bcb929801b1884cce701f7fcd855b05f0d401/2002/README.md","https://github.com/Ch4120N/Ch4120N-CVE-Pulse/blob/91ab7783643591e4c1949aca858fc331aabcb87c/CVEs/2002/CVE-2002-0083.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6052148b71cb79d42fd4a59f87982387b0487834/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-0083.json","https://github.com/brenonevs/prs-pentest/blob/001cf17eedeb4aad73618d3140ca1f5dc93e69b3/CVEs & POCs/2002/CVE-2002-0083.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0142.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0141","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0141.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-0082","title":"Apache mod_ssl 远程缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"Apache mod_ssl 2.8.7 之前版本及 Apache-SSL 1.3.22+1.46 之前版本的 dbm 和 shm 会话缓存代码中，i2d_SSL_SESSION 函数未正确初始化内存，存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。远程攻击者可通过提交由受信任 CA 签名的超大客户端证书，生成超大的序列化会话数据触发该漏洞，导致远程代码执行。该漏洞影响运行 mod_ssl 的 Apache HTTP Server，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高，攻击者无需身份认证即可远程利用。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2002-0082"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2002-03-15T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:56:44Z","remediation":"升级 Apache mod_ssl 至 2.8.7-1.3.23 及以上版本，或升级 Apache-SSL 至 1.3.22+1.46 及以上版本。如无法升级，在 Apache 配置中禁用客户端证书验证（将 SSLVerifyClient 设为 none）并限制可信 CA 签发的大证书以降低风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://distro.conectiva.com.br/atualizacoes/?id=a&anuncio=000465","http://ftp.support.compaq.com/patches/.new/html/SSRT0817.shtml","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=101518491916936&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=101528358424306&w=2","http://online.securityfocus.com/archive/1/258646","http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/153567/Apache-mod_ssl-OpenSSL-Remote-Buffer-Overflow.html","http://www.apacheweek.com/issues/02-03-01#security","http://www.calderasystems.com/support/security/advisories/CSSA-2002-011.0.txt","http://www.debian.org/security/2002/dsa-120","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/8308.php","http://www.linux-mandrake.com/en/security/2002/MDKSA-2002-020.php","http://www.linuxsecurity.com/advisories/other_advisory-1923.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2002-041.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2002-042.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2002-045.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/advisories/3965","http://www.securityfocus.com/advisories/4008","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/4189","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/47080","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2002/CVE-2002-0082.md","https://github.com/0xMarcio/cve/blob/b6e8cb5bd39fed494b7be90b0ffddcadd3893758/2002/CVE-2002-0082.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/7fe82fb470b3291b506f74c6717a29e3837f8a29/2002/CVE-2002-0082.json","https://github.com/arschlochnop/VulnWatchdog/blob/01bb07dab634a3755d075f3c8d43bf71b1a9222d/data/by-cve/CVE-2002-0082.md","https://github.com/sari3l/Poc-Monitor/blob/bf6bcb929801b1884cce701f7fcd855b05f0d401/2002/CVE-2002-0082.json","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2002/CVE-2002-0082.md","https://github.com/arschlochnop/VulnWatchdog/blob/01bb07dab634a3755d075f3c8d43bf71b1a9222d/data/2002/CVE-2002-0082-ratiros01_CVE-2002-0082.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/487ea3f21ed49470634e758e1f8f2ac74b64d6b0/cves/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0082.json","https://github.com/kaismax/CVE-Poc/blob/6d8c93dabf674cea102713781cc534d577412357/2002/CVE-2002-0082.md","https://github.com/PwnAwan/CVEs/blob/967839a1f3dd2e43c3ca7af98749ae1712e69a04/2002/CVE-2002-0082.md","https://github.com/ratiros01/CVE-2002-0082","https://github.com/anilkashyap01/Binary-Exploitation-and-Kernel-Escalation"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0141.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0140","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0140.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-0080","title":"Samba rsync 特权管理不当漏洞","description":"rsync 以守护进程模式运行时，在降低权限前未正确调用 setgroups 函数清除补充组权限，导致本地用户可利用该缺陷继承额外的组特权，从而读取本应被禁止访问的文件。该漏洞影响多个 Linux/Unix 发行版中默认安装的 rsync 守护进程版本，攻击者需拥有本地系统访问权限，利用难度较低，可造成敏感信息泄露。建议升级至 rsync 2.5.6 及以上版本修复此问题。","severity":"LOW","score":2.1,"aliases":["CVE-2002-0080"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2002-03-15T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:56:43Z","remediation":"升级 rsync 至 2.5.3 或更高版本。Red Hat 用户可运行 `up2date rsync` 安装 RHSA-2002:026 提供的更新包；Mandrake 用户安装 MDKSA-2002:024 更新。如无法升级，在 rsyncd.conf 中设置 `use chroot = yes` 并限制 `uid = nobody` 和 `gid = nobody`，避免 rsync 以 root 权限运行 daemon 模式。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.caldera.com/support/security/advisories/CSSA-2002-014.1.txt","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/8463.php","http://www.linux-mandrake.com/en/security/2002/MDKSA-2002-024.php3","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2002-026.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/4285","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/87c3c6939cf4753db954551441a9567082e88cc1/cves/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0080.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-0080","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/da07cb97146d03883b70ca493bde18a430b683ac/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0080.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/9fb6bc21273092ff8b91677561ee0f67b063fcda/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-0080.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/8fd24b26179bcdde52e301aef6d16b0838932c28/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-mghq-fcpm-9vvg/GHSA-mghq-fcpm-9vvg.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2002-0080.md","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cwe_details/cwe_details_500_600.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/Team-Atlanta/aixcc-asc-atlantis/blob/785c446f980e12155935db586aa30c3b54adcc86/crs/src/crs-patch/smith/smith/lib/cwe/raw/CWE-842.txt","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--5231a28f-84e5-4602-8997-ed97ae341787.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0140.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0131","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0131.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-0059","title":"zlib 数据解压缩双重释放远程代码执行漏洞","description":"zlib 1.1.3 及更早版本的解压缩算法中存在双重释放（double free）漏洞，当 inflateEnd 函数处理特制的畸形压缩数据时，会多次释放同一内存区域，导致堆内存损坏。远程攻击者可通过向使用 zlib 的应用程序（如 Web 服务器、SSH 客户端、压缩工具等）发送恶意构造的压缩数据块触发该漏洞，成功利用可实现任意代码执行。由于 zlib 被大量第三方软件和操作系统广泛集成，该漏洞影响范围极广，危害严重。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2002-0059"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2002-03-15T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:56:40Z","remediation":"立即将 zlib 升级至 1.1.4 或更高版本（1.1.4 于 2002 年 3 月发布，修复了 inflateEnd 双重释放问题）。各 Linux 发行版用户应通过包管理器更新：Debian/Ubuntu 执行 apt-get install --only-upgrade zlib1g，Red Hat/CentOS 执行 yum update zlib，或参照 RHSA-2002-026/RHSA-2002-027 安装对应补丁。如无法升级，可在应用层对传入的压缩数据做完整性校验，并限制仅接受可信来源的压缩数据流。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://distro.conectiva.com.br/atualizacoes/?id=a&anuncio=000469","http://frontal2.mandriva.com/security/advisories?name=MDKSA-2002:022","http://www.caldera.com/support/security/advisories/CSSA-2002-014.1.txt","http://www.cert.org/advisories/CA-2002-07.html","http://www.debian.org/security/2002/dsa-122","http://www.kb.cert.org/vuls/id/368819","http://www.linux-mandrake.com/en/security/2002/MDKSA-2002-023.php","http://www.linux-mandrake.com/en/security/2002/MDKSA-2002-024.php3","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2002-026.html","http://w